{"quest_id": 7038, "name": "神聖騎士団の企み", "description": "フィナンまでも生贄に捧げ、召喚の儀式を\n行おうとする神聖騎士団。白騎士の猛攻を\n跳ね返し、儀式の進行を阻止せよ！\n上級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv10）", "event": "捧げし信仰、奪われた意思", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920144, "map_no": 3433, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 65, "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 14, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 400, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 400, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097264, "master_id": 7}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー", "神聖騎士団"], "hp": 4000, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 4000, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 1500, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 167, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2122400, "special_effect_id": 510, "master_id": 32496, "global_id": 6115}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アイドルリノのファン"], "hp": 700, "attack": 120, "base_hp": 700, "base_attack": 120, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 126, "move_speed": 800.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2121600, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 32453, "global_id": 6072}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アイドルリノのファン"], "hp": 500, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 500, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 136, "move_speed": 400.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2121616, "race_id": 16, "master_id": 32454, "global_id": 6073}, {"enemy_id": 5, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 1500, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 1500, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 300, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 20, "attack_interval": 166, "move_speed": 1500.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104576, "master_id": 803, "global_id": 802, "spawn_sec": 68}, {"enemy_id": 6, "source": "local", "count": 11, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2800, "attack": 600, "base_hp": 2800, "base_attack": 600, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_speed": 58, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 127, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2097712, "master_id": 40, "global_id": 39, "spawn_sec": 72}, {"enemy_id": 7, "source": "local", "count": 3, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 2000, "attack": 450, "base_hp": 2000, "base_attack": 450, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 250, "attack_range": 200, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 90, "attack_interval": 261, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.399999976158142, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2098480, "missile_id": 41, "missile": {"speed": 4.0, "splash": 133}, "master_id": 98, "global_id": 97, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 85}, {"enemy_id": 8, "source": "local", "count": 2, "form_count": 1, "tags": ["アーマー"], "hp": 1400, "attack": 150, "base_hp": 1400, "base_attack": 150, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 200, "attack_range": 150, "attack_speed": 90, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 181, "move_speed": 450.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 1000, "transform_resist": 1000, "pattern_id": 2104592, "missile_id": 46, "missile": {"speed": 12.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 728, "global_id": 727, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 105}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "――準備を急げ、敬虔なる信徒たちよ。\n敵は魔王を討った王子だ。\nすぐにこの場所も見つかることだろう。", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "トゥアン……わ、私、トゥアンを、殺すだなんて……。\nどうしてそんなことをしようと……！", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "どうやら、信仰が足りないようだな。\nフィナンよ、あちらで教えを受けてきたまえ。\n儀式の準備が整うまで静かにしているのだ。", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "やっ……いやっ！\n助けてっ、トゥアン！　トゥアンお姉ちゃん！！", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "トゥアン", "text": "……よく響く声だ。\n望み通り、助けに来たぞフィナン。", "face": "u1006a1"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "想定よりも随分と早いな……。\nお前、フィナンに再度支配の魔法をかけておけ。", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団の手下", "text": "はっ！", "face": "l68d9ae39636d"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "あの御方の降臨も目前なのだ。\n魔法陣の完成まで、時間を稼がせてもらおうか。", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "トゥアン", "text": "王子、頼り切りですまねぇ。\nだが、どうかお前の力を貸してくれ。", "face": "u1006a1"}, {"name": "トゥアン", "text": "フィナンは故郷を失い、ひとりきりになったあたしに、\nただひとり声をかけてくれた大切な友達なんだ。\n必ずこの借りは返す。だから……！", "face": "u1006a1"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "トゥアン", "text": "……恩に着るぜ。\nあたしは向こうの鎧を受け持つ、\nこの辺りは王子、お前に任せたぞ！", "face": "u1006a1"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "くっ……何という強さだ……。\nだが、魔法陣の起動はもはや目前だ！", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "エルヴァ", "text": "何なのこいつら。\nリビングアーマーって言っても、\n暗黒騎士とは全くの別物ね……。", "face": "u211"}, {"name": "コーネリア", "text": "人が信仰だけで、こんな姿になることはないだろう。\n何か異質な存在から力を借りているということか。", "face": "u209"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "ふふ、そのとおりだ。\n我らはあの御方より神の力を授かった！", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "我らこそあの御方への信仰の伝道者！\n地上に蔓延る邪教を駆逐する者！", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}, {"name": "フィナン", "text": "――邪教たるアイギスの信徒を、滅ぼす者。", "face": "u1003a1"}, {"name": "神聖騎士団員", "text": "おお、フィナンの支配も完了したか。\nさぁ王子よ、あの御方が降臨する様を見届けるがいい！", "face": "l7a2e1c209b24"}]}], "active": true}